# Template discovery, money splash, idle board (s3.1.7)

Resume: `@templates$` / `$money-rain$`.

## Venue-exclusive templates

- Patron picker reads only packaged `window.SHOUTOUT_TEMPLATES` (never the Firestore `templates` collection). Ids = `blackwhite` + `location.templates` + templates whose `venueIds` include the venue + standard ids, then `status==='active'` + `templateFitsVenue`.
- Default view: Default Template card, then **Exclusive at {venue}** (`template.venueExclusive`, all 11 chrome packs) listing every record whose `venueIds` includes the current venue.
- Search box (`submitCategoryVenueQuery`) and FloqAi intents (`action:"template"`) route template names through `exclusiveTemplateForQuery` (name + `searchAliases`, accent/punctuation-insensitive, ≥ 4 chars) → `startTemplateShoutout`: one venue → ad splash → composer; several → venue grid filtered to `venueIds`; the name is pre-filled into `#templateSearch`.
- Zebbies All-Stars Football Intro: `zebbies-garden-washington-dc`, `heist-washington-dc`, `temp-democlub-1` (Aurelia). Backend checkout set must match.

## Club Admin template repository + forgiving match (s3.1.8)

- Heist was already assigned every Heist template (live `clubLocations/heist-washington-dc.templates` + packaged `templates` + `venueIds`; checkout `HEIST_ART_TEMPLATE_IDS`). The s3.1.8 bug was **findability**, not assignment.
- `window.FLOQRTemplateMatch` (`shared-data.js`): `normalize` (NFD, accent strip, lowercase), `phraseMatches(query, phrase)` (every phrase word must match; plural `s` stems; **one** typo allowed only when the phrase has ≥ 2 words of ≥ 4 chars, so "looked up" never routes to "Locked Up"), `textMatches(query, text)` (admin filter: each query word is a substring or within edit distance 1, 2 for ≥ 7 chars), `templateText(template)`.
- Used by patron `exclusiveTemplateForQuery`, Club Admin `templateMatchesQuery`. FloqAi tengo intent regex accepts `te\w{2,3} mucho(s) d[oó]lar`.
- `renderClubTemplateBackgrounds` dedupes by `template.id` (alias `heistRedLux` shares `id:"heistVaultDollars"`), orders club-exclusive (`venueIds` includes the club) → assigned → rest, and tags exclusives with **Exclusive at {venue}**.
- Seed script `functions/scripts/onboard-dc-venues.js` assigns `heistVaultDollars` (not the alias).
- Admin help id `help-club-template-repository` (venueAdmin, all 11 langs).

## Tengo muchos dólares (`heistVaultDollars`, legacy `heistRedLux`)

Template fields: `moneyRain:true`, `moneyRainDelaySeconds:40`. `display-app.js` `syncMoneyRain` builds `#displayMoneyRain` right after `#displayBackground` (z-index 1).

| Time from presentation start | Layer classes | What shows |
|---|---|---|
| 0 → 40 s | none | Normal ShoutOut (vault background) |
| 40 s | `is-blast` (2.6 s) + canvas `money-shake` (0.7 s, background only) | Flash, shockwave ring, steel door disc blows toward the viewer, shards, smoke |
| 40.3 s | `is-flood` (7.4 s) | 8×6 grid of 25vw bills bursts from the vault (48% / 43%) and covers the whole board, then falls away |
| 44.2 s → end | `is-stream` | 30 smaller (15vw) bills keep splashing from the vault |

- Presentation start = `approvedAt` when it is within the last 10 minutes, else first render. A Xibo reload after the blast window resumes directly in `is-stream`.
- Timeline restarts only when `livePlaybackKey(data)` changes. `purgeDisplaySurface` → `stopMoneyRain` clears timers.
- **Verbiage on top:** `.money-rain-active .display-text-overlay{z-index:5}` + heavy dark text-shadow on `#displayMain`, `#displaySub`, `.classic-board-lines b`. Never put bills above the text overlay.
- Heist brand slide (20 s message / 8 s slide cycle) hides the money layer; 40 s lands in the second message phase.
- Bills are pure CSS (no image asset). Colors: saturated green `#1f9a44`–`#7dea7a`, border `#0b5a25`.

## Idle board

- Display 1 idle text is always `Use ShoutOut @ {club}` (`clubDefaultMainText`; configured `defaultMain` is ignored on primary). Display 2 keeps the SupRstar idle CTA.
- Display treats any doc with `status:"default"`, `idleCta`, missing doc, or no status + no text/media as idle → `defaultClubDisplayPayload()`.
- `expireLiveShoutouts` (every minute) overwrites expired `liveContent` with `idleLiveContentAfterExpiry` (blackwhite, `Use ShoutOut @ {club}`, `idleCta:true`, `source:"automaticTenMinuteReset"`). No Heist exception. The helper is **not** exported (index.js spreads module exports into deployed functions).
- **Reset display to default** writes the same text + `idleCta:true`.
- **s3.1.9 bug + fix:** approve merges onto the idle doc, so `idleCta:true` / `source:automaticTenMinuteReset` survived and the board hid the approved ShoutOut (Heist SO-0752287). Board uses `isIdlePayload` (status `approved`/`live`/`preview` is never idle). Club Admin approve and `messagingInboundWebhook` approve write `idleCta:false`, a `source`, and delete `expiredAt`.

Tests: `functions/template-discovery-idle.test.js`, `functions/heist-template-availability.test.js`.
